  "description": "Programmatic access to the Temporal Cloud control plane via the Cloud Operations (Ops) API. Provides read access to your account, namespaces, users, and service accounts for auditing, inventory, and connectivity checks. (Temporal Cloud exposes workflow execution over gRPC only, so starting or signalling workflows is not available over this HTTP API.)",
  "display_name": "Temporal",
  "id": "temporal"
